{"id":"palma","lemma":"palma","pos":"noun","rank":4240,"glosses":["palm of the hand","palm tree","palm leaf"],"ipa":"/ˈpalma/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"palmas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-palma.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mis palmas sudaban.","en":"My palms were sweaty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454992","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to sweat","l":"sudar"}]},{"text":"Conoce la zona como la palma de su mano.","en":"He knows the area like the back of his hand.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691374","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"zone, district, area"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"hand"}]},{"text":"Conozco esta zona como la palma de mi mano.","en":"I know this area like the back of my hand.","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"zone, district, area"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"hand"}]},{"text":"A Tom le leyeron la palma.","en":"Tom had his palm read.","words":[{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to read","l":"leer"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Puedo poner las palmas de las manos en el suelo sin doblar las rodillas.","en":"I can place the palms of my hands on the floor without bending my knees.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610969","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to put, to place"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"hand","l":"mano"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"dirt"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"to fold"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"knee","l":"rodilla"}]}]}